                            A record with no observed response never matches.
  --filter-method <method>  HTTP method (GET, POST, \u2026)
  --limit <n>               list at most n matching rows; default ${DEFAULT_HAR_ROWS} (${DEFAULT_FULL_HAR_ROWS} with --full)
